1
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,640
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,600
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,672
=Episode 3=

4
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,439
Mr. Zhang,

5
00:00:56,439 --> 00:00:57,920
what did I do to offend you?

6
00:00:58,439 --> 00:01:00,159
You made my wife look this beautiful.

7
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,359
I don't even know your name.

8
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:05,200
Zhao Ke, senior beauty specialist.

9
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,959
My work ID is in the case.

10
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:09,239
See for yourself
if you don't believe me.

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,239
Miss Zhao, you look very much like

12
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,760
an old friend of mine.

13
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:16,599
I wonder if

14
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:19,439
you would let me take a closer look.

15
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:27,480
Miss Lin is my most valued client.

16
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:30,120
I won't indulge her husband's curiosity.

17
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:30,879
Please let go of me.

18
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:31,840
(Ms. Su.)

19
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,879
(What brings you here?)

20
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,079
Let go of me.

21
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:43,799
(Zhang Haotian.)

22
00:01:44,079 --> 00:01:47,359
(The game has officially begun.)

23
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:09,199
A beauty specialist named

24
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,479
Zhao Ke has appeared by Lin Lulu's side.

25
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,520
She looks exactly like Jiang Lai.

26
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:13,680
Jiang Lai is dead.

27
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,840
I confirmed it myself.

28
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,840
Doctor, how is Jiang Lai?

29
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:21,400
I'm sorry.

30
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,439
We did everything we could.

31
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:26,840
And you're still not convinced?

32
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,080
No, I'm not.

33
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,960
Fine. I'll look into it again.

34
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:42,120
(This mansion envied by everyone)

35
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:44,360
(is that villain's safe haven)

36
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:46,560
(and my hunting ground.)

37
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:58,159
My bride looks so beautiful.

38
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,439
The dress is beautiful.

39
00:03:21,639 --> 00:03:22,439
Miss Lin.

40
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,759
Please wait a moment.

41
00:03:25,759 --> 00:03:26,680
I'll get everything ready.

42
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:47,919
Tell me.

43
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,400
Jiang Lai is definitely dead.

44
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:51,840
Her household registration
has even been canceled.

45
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,680
Something still feels wrong.

46
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,000
Putting aside the fact
that they look alike,

47
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,599
this is way too much of a coincidence.

48
00:03:59,319 --> 00:04:00,759
At my wedding,

49
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,000
she shows up as Lin Lulu's
makeup artist.

50
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,479
Stop scaring yourself.

51
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:07,599
If she really were Jiang Lai,

52
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,919
wouldn't she expose you at the wedding?

53
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:13,000
You think a few words from her
could bring me down?

54
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,520
If so, I wouldn't have made it this far.

55
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,720
You said before

56
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,920
someone secretly filmed me and Lin Lulu

57
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,160
and sent it to Jiang Lai, right?

58
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:21,639
You think

59
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:24,120
Jiang Lai intentionally

60
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:27,000
planned to become her makeup artist?

61
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,800
Zhao Ke? Nonsense.

62
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,720
She's Jiang Lai.

63
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:32,639
She faked her death,

64
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,920
came back,

65
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:35,160
and changed her identity.

66
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:37,160
She's been patient.

67
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,680
Is she really still alive?

68
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,720
Chen Ping.

69
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,879
Don't do anything for now.

70
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:44,800
Zhao Ke.

71
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,639
Investigate Zhao Ke thoroughly.

72
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:05,839
Miss Lin, you're all done.

73
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:08,079
I'd like to use the restroom
to wash my hands.

74
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:11,079
Sure. Run my bath while you're at it.

75
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,079
I want to take a bath.

76
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:13,000
Okay.

77
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,160
Mr. Zhang.

78
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,680
I'm sorry,

79
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,360
but I've finished my work.

80
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,639
I'll be leaving now.

81
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:00,759
Mr. Zhang.

82
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:03,279
Let go of me.

83
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:06,879
Fine.

84
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:10,000
Mr. Zhang, show some respect.

85
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,079
One night with me.

86
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,800
Name your price.

87
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,480
Zhang Haotian.

88
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,879
Having me means paying a price.

89
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,200
(The Hunting Ground)

90
00:07:22,272 --> 00:07:26,730
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

91
00:07:27,264 --> 00:07:30,430
♪I should forget you♪

92
00:07:30,512 --> 00:07:35,360
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

93
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:37,504
♪To carry on♪

94
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:42,992
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

95
00:07:43,056 --> 00:07:45,470
♪You no longer have the strength♪

96
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:50,000
♪You want me to go there for you♪

97
00:07:51,700 --> 00:07:56,960
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

98
00:07:57,712 --> 00:08:00,960
♪Your freedom♪

99
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:06,030
♪Has become my cage♪

100
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:13,552
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

101
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:19,104
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

102
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:25,984
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

103
00:08:26,620 --> 00:08:29,461
♪You told me♪

104
00:08:29,462 --> 00:08:34,576
♪I would shine like a star♪

105
00:08:35,536 --> 00:08:39,368
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

106
00:08:39,369 --> 00:08:43,200
♪How to live without you♪

107
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:49,616
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

108
00:08:51,024 --> 00:08:54,120
♪So hazy and blurred♪
